Refinery

Refineries convert <a href="petroleum">petroleum</a> into <a href="goods">goods</a>. They consume petroleum and labor to produce goods.

Refineries need <a href="labor">labor</a> and a supply of petroleum to operate.

IMG_1[This is a refinery]: images/tiles/refinery-empty.png
IMG_2[and this is its icon]: images/gui/buttonpanel/industry/refinery.png

SUBH: Formulas

1: 200 labor + 5 petroleum =&gt; 3 goods

Refineries target producing goods as long as labor and petroleum are available.

